  "bodyHash": "RNKFZB+6db0=",
  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0BsNlDT.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/C2JV3xu.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/适用于 Minecraft-1.19 | 1.18-ecebe6?labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge\" width=\"295\" height=\"28\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/安装于-客户端 &amp; 服务端-ecebe6?labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge\" width=\"240\" height=\"28\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/magnum-torch-forge/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=2020709689:7498\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3yrSsw7\" width=\"320\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzles-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3jr9xQw\" width=\"215\" height=\"28\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/magnum-torch-forge/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=2020709689:7499\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3nRXr4m\" width=\"325\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/30lZmFY\" width=\"208\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzles-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3jr9xQw\" width=\"215\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forge-config-api-port-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3clkhvn\" width=\"299\" height=\"28\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/C2JV3xu.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>📖 关于：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>巨型火把</strong> 增加了三种非常强大的火把，能够防止生物在巨大范围内生成。仅阻止自然生成，因此刷怪笼和袭击等依然正常运作。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/C2JV3xu.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>📚 内容：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">你合成的巨型火把类型决定了它将阻止哪种生物生成。只有新生物会被阻止生成，世界中已存在的生物不会在放置巨型火把后立即消失！</span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>钻石：</strong> 所有怪物，例如僵尸、骷髅、苦力怕、蜘蛛、幻翼等。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>绿宝石：</strong> 被动生物，如流浪商人和行商羊驼（动物理论上受影响，但实际上它们仅在世界生成或繁殖时出现，而两者均不受巨型火把影响）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>紫水晶：</strong> 洞穴和水域生物，如蝙蝠、所有鱿鱼、美西螈和所有鱼类</span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">更棒的是：每种巨型火把都可完全自定义，包括有效范围、防止生物生成的形状（长方体、圆柱体、椭球体）、单个生物的白/黑名单、被阻止的生物类型（怪物/水域/洞穴/被动）。因此，如果你愿意，可以完全改变不同种类的功能，例如让一种只阻止幻翼生成，另一种专门对付流浪商人，而第三种禁用所有鱼类。完全由你决定！</span></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/C2JV3xu.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>📷 媒体：</strong></span></p><table style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/440/542/2022-03-12_15.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/440/543/2022-03-13_11.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>三种巨型火把，各自阻止不同的生物生成</strong></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><strong>村庄中的绿宝石巨型火把</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/440/544/2022-03-13_11.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/440/545/2022-03-13_10.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>物品提示告诉你所有你需要知道的重要变量</strong></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><strong>合成钻石巨型火把</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/440/546/2022-03-13_10.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/440/547/2022-03-13_10.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>合成绿宝石巨型火把</strong></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><strong>合成紫水晶巨型火把</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/C2JV3xu.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>💡 常见问题：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>问：在Forge上如何配置这个模组？</strong><br><strong>答：</strong> 安装我的 <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Config Menus for Forge</strong></span></a> 模组并直接在游戏中操作！</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>问：在Fabric上如何配置这个模组？</strong><br><strong>答：</strong> 在游戏中直接编辑配置尚未实现。反之，在世界中运行 <code>/config showfile &lt;modid&gt;</code> 命令，选择 <code>CLIENT</code> 或 <code>SERVER</code>（取决于模组），然后点击聊天中出现的文件名（以.toml结尾），即可在单独的编辑器手动编辑配置文件。保存文件后，配置将在几秒后自动在游戏中重新加载，无需重启游戏。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>问：在哪可以下载适用于Minecraft 1.19之前版本的Fabric版模组？</strong><br><strong>答：</strong> 旧版下载可在 <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/magnum-torch-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>旧项目页面</strong></span></a> 找到。</span></span></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/C2JV3xu.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>🏆 鸣谢：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">巨型火把的开发受到以下启发和帮助：</span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/rwtema\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>RWTema</strong></span></a> 因其模组 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/extra-utilities\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Extra Utilities</span></a> 旧版本中的巨型火把方块启发了本模组</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/nyffuuuh23\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Nyffuuuh23</strong></span></a> 制作了精美的纹理</span></li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/C2JV3xu.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/lunapixelstudios/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=CurseForge&amp;message=LunaPixelStudios&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"282\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://twitter.com/LunaPixelStudio\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/LunaPixelStudio?label=Twitter&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=twitter&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"149\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/8ZmhaPPbjE\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?label=Discord&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"220\" height=\"28\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1MOyd2u.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"300\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Fuzs_&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"97\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Fuzss&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"97\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC2l26SuCmCNSCPefpfbCX7Q\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Fuzs&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"89\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://twitter.com/Fusseel\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=@Fusseel&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=twitter&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"124\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.reddit.com%252fuser%252fFusseel\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=u/Fusseel&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=reddit&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"Reddit\" width=\"130\" height=\"28\"></a> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Fuzs 0212&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"127\" height=\"28\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/C2JV3xu.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><table style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/kiHP8s9.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/universal-bone-meal-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/q3CooZb.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bag-of-holding-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8gTQlTt.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/block-runner-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5rv6nTt.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-shulker-boxes-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vz0tBff.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/universal-enchants-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MynoO6R.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sneaky-curses-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/LgxIMFS.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/trading-post\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/UzgNFIB.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-animations-collection\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/OVV5lXk.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stylish-effects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fmWwWkZ.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/C2JV3xu.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>",
